{"about_the_game":"D-1 until the deadline\u2014the chairman\u2019s daughter has gone missing again.<br>As the heiress of a vast conglomerate, she bribed college students with her beauty and money.<br>In every downtown district, hordes of fanatics will block your path.<br><br>With your fists, a rapier, and a variety of weapons, mow down the troublemakers with style.<br>As the story progresses, hidden truths between the main characters will come to light.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy controls, exhilarating hit feel, unbroken combos!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147690/extras/aaa1313a7b461579ebccd5a657a30ffe.poster.avif?t=1769071232\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147690/extras/aaa1313a7b461579ebccd5a657a30ffe.webm?t=1769071232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147690/extras/aaa1313a7b461579ebccd5a657a30ffe.mp4?t=1769071232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Feel the thrill of musou action that sends dozens flying at once.<br>Overwhelm your foes with relentless combos, then annihilate the screen-filling hordes with Rage Arts.<br><br>A B-grade, cathartic game that blows away group-project stress.<br>Packed with satisfying impact and 100% relatable satire.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A drama of betrayal and friendship woven by five characters.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147690/extras/5f7ece6b3e1efd262cbed3631078a8fd.poster.avif?t=1769071232\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147690/extras/5f7ece6b3e1efd262cbed3631078a8fd.webm?t=1769071232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147690/extras/5f7ece6b3e1efd262cbed3631078a8fd.mp4?t=1769071232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A yakuza-like fighter, a romance-fantasy knight, a gamer princess, a plain old NEET big sister, and an airheaded band vocalist\u2026<br>Each is a distinctive character with a unique combat style.<br><br>However, the four you don\u2019t choose\u2026<br>are bribed by the chairman\u2019s daughter and become the boss of each stage.<br>\u201c1,000$\u2026 Rent\u2019s due tomorrow. I\u2019m sorry.\u201d<br>\u201cThey said I can become a real noble\u2026 Forgive me.\u201d<br><br>Friends who betrayed you for their own desperate reasons.<br>Defeat them, awaken them.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I can\u2019t take it anymore.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147690/extras/6384afff19e9dd0f4322f617e839af65.avif?t=1769071232\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br>D-1 to the deadline\u2014club photos on social media.<br>DMs left on read, no one picks up the phone.<br>The excuse: \u201cI was too busy~.\u201d<br>I can\u2019t take it anymore.<br>I\u2019m going to catch you myself.<br><br>\u201cThe last slide is your part!!!\u201d","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4147690?t=1769071232","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4147690?t=1769071232","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147690/27754c6a547dd0c1227863db8f1e2129afe72b03/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769071232","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147690/27754c6a547dd0c1227863db8f1e2129afe72b03/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769071232","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1